.Sh CAVEATS
Calling
.Fa destroy
on a page allocator calls a null pointer.
.Pp
.Fn xft_alloc_clone
treats a null
.Fa self Ns .vtable ,
a null
.Fa allocate
entry or a null
.Fa buffer Ns .mem
as unreachable; the behaviour is undefined.
.Fa buffer Ns .size
must be nonzero.
